  "text": {
    "en": {
      "text": "Sword Kills grants 1 stack of 'Gathering Light'. Maximum of 10 stacks.\n\nGathering Light benefits at 1|2|3|...|10 Stacks:\n\n• ? Guard Resistance\n• ? Guard Endurance\n• 10%|20%|30%|...|100% increased lunge distance\n\nStowing the sword consumes all stacks, granting 10% Grenade, Melee, and Class Ability energy per stack.\n\n#ChunkEnergyScalars",
      "updatedAt": "2026-01-16T23:34:56.416Z",
      "updatedBy": "Hawkmoona"
    }
  },
  "associated": [],
